{
  "title": "s3g Thru",
  "children": [
    {
      "title": "Getting started",
      "children": [
        {
          "title": "First sound",
          "lines": [
            "Track 1-4 selects a",
            "lane. Shift + Track",
            "opens its sample",
            "browser. Turn the",
            "main encoder to",
            "browse; click to load",
            "a WAV.",
            "",
            "Press note pads to",
            "play. Fill other lanes",
            "before scanning",
            "across them: an empty",
            "lane is silent."
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Pages and knobs",
          "lines": [
            "Menu opens parameter",
            "pages. The eight",
            "screen cells match",
            "knobs 1-8. Up/Down",
            "changes pages.",
            "",
            "Hold Capture and",
            "press Menu for the",
            "Pages picker. Release",
            "Capture, choose a",
            "page, and click to",
            "open. Back returns."
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Pads and hold",
          "lines": [
            "In Keys mode, Up/Down",
            "changes octave on the",
            "waveform page. Pads &",
            "Scale sets Root, Scale",
            "and pad mode.",
            "",
            "Shift + pad toggles a",
            "held note. Hold Off",
            "chooses manual",
            "release or an",
            "automatic delay. In",
            "Cues mode, Shift +",
            "pad stores a cue",
            "instead.",
            "",
            "Amp Envelope sets",
            "attack, decay, sustain",
            "and release. Pad",
            "velocity does not set",
            "sample volume."
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Samples",
      "children": [
        {
          "title": "Load a WAV",
          "lines": [
            "Shift + Track 1-4",
            "opens the browser",
            "for that lane. Choose",
            "Move Samples or Thru",
            "Recordings.",
            "",
            "Main turn or Up/Down",
            "selects. A highlighted",
            "WAV auditions at",
            "Preview Level. Click",
            "to load; Back goes up",
            "or closes the",
            "browser.",
            "",
            "Mono and stereo WAVs",
            "load. The lane",
            "capacity is 12",
            "seconds; longer files",
            "are truncated."
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Stereo recording",
          "lines": [
            "Choose Move mic or",
            "line input and its",
            "hardware input gain",
            "first. Use headphones",
            "for mic recording.",
            "",
            "Track 1-4 selects the",
            "destination. Shift +",
            "Record starts and",
            "stops stereo audio",
            "capture. The take",
            "becomes that lane",
            "source.",
            "",
            "Mix / Rec sets SRC,",
            "Record Gain and",
            "Monitor. Keep Monitor",
            "at zero unless direct",
            "monitoring is wanted.",
            "SRC can also resample",
            "the mix or a part."
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Saved takes",
          "lines": [
            "Completed captures",
            "and sample edits",
            "create new WAVs in",
            "Thru Recordings. A",
            "later recording",
            "replaces the lane",
            "assignment and keeps",
            "the older file.",
            "",
            "Each clip recalls its",
            "own source",
            "assignments. Undo can",
            "restore the latest",
            "source change. Wait",
            "for saving to finish",
            "before powering off."
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Sample editing",
          "lines": [
            "Select the lane with",
            "Track, then open its",
            "Sample page. Trim,",
            "Reverse, Normalize",
            "and Fade act on that",
            "lane.",
            "",
            "Turn an action",
            "encoder to apply it.",
            "Each committed edit",
            "saves a new WAV. Stop",
            "recording before",
            "using Undo to restore",
            "the latest edit."
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Lanes and engines",
      "children": [
        {
          "title": "Waveform controls",
          "lines": [
            "POS moves the source",
            "window; FLD sets its",
            "width. The waveforms",
            "zoom to that region.",
            "SPD sets transport",
            "speed; note pitch is",
            "additional.",
            "",
            "Where available, STAK",
            "sets the stack start",
            "and RATE its scan",
            "speed. Cutups uses",
            "LANE and ADV instead.",
            "Quad reserves these",
            "stack controls."
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Stack movement",
          "lines": [
            "Each voice follows its",
            "own path through the",
            "available lanes.",
            "Pressure offsets",
            "that voice when",
            "Pressure is Offset.",
            "",
            "Loop holds the",
            "current lane",
            "positions, including",
            "blends. Press again",
            "to resume. Note",
            "release keeps a held",
            "position for",
            "retriggering.",
            "",
            "Stack Path offers the",
            "route. For DRAW, click",
            "the main encoder to",
            "edit its points. Back",
            "returns. Cutups",
            "advances lanes by",
            "cuts; Loop pauses",
            "that advancement."
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Engine guide",
          "lines": [
            "Choose an engine on",
            "the Engine page. Its",
            "parameter pages",
            "follow the current",
            "editing focus.",
            "",
            "MOTION: moving stacks.",
            "LANES: layer blends.",
            "GRAINS: short grains.",
            "CUTUPS: cut and",
            "repeat. SAMPLE: direct",
            "playback. SLICES:",
            "playable slices.",
            "GLITCH: buffer",
            "stutters. WEAVE: long",
            "grains. WAVESETS:",
            "zero-crossing",
            "segments. PRISM:",
            "spectral playback.",
            "MORPH: spectral blends",
            "and Imprint. TEXTURE:",
            "grouped grains.",
            "FORMANT:",
            "pitch-synchronous",
            "grains.",
            "",
            "Use the online manual",
            "for each engine",
            "parameter."
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Instrument modes",
      "children": [
        {
          "title": "Choose a mode",
          "lines": [
            "Hold Capture and",
            "press Menu. Release",
            "Capture, choose",
            "Instrument Mode, then",
            "click the desired mode",
            "to apply. Stop",
            "recording first.",
            "",
            "Outside clip and chain",
            "editors, Copy toggles",
            "Single and the last",
            "selected",
            "multi-instrument mode."
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Single and Split",
          "lines": [
            "Single: all four lanes",
            "form one stack, with",
            "up to eight voices.",
            "",
            "Split: left and right",
            "pad halves play A and",
            "B. A uses lanes 1-2; B",
            "uses 3-4. Each side",
            "has four voices and",
            "its own engine",
            "settings.",
            "",
            "Tap Capture to",
            "change editing focus.",
            "Waveform knob 8 is",
            "BLND in dual modes;",
            "its midpoint includes",
            "both parts."
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Shared Dual / Quad",
          "lines": [
            "Shared Dual: A and B",
            "use the same four",
            "source lanes with",
            "independent engines",
            "and settings. Each",
            "side has four voices.",
            "",
            "Quad: four pad",
            "quadrants play A-D,",
            "with two voices each",
            "and one lane per",
            "part. Track 1-4",
            "selects the part and",
            "lane.",
            "",
            "Tap Capture to cycle",
            "focus. Playing another",
            "part does not change",
            "editing focus."
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Levels and effects",
          "lines": [
            "In multi modes, each",
            "part has its own",
            "level, mute and",
            "private processing.",
            "Delay and Reverb use",
            "shared sends and",
            "returns. Tape and",
            "mastering are shared.",
            "",
            "Capture + Menu opens",
            "Pages. Choose FX",
            "SENDS for send and",
            "return levels. Both",
            "must be raised for a",
            "shared effect to",
            "sound.",
            "",
            "Mute toggles the",
            "focused part. In dual",
            "modes, check Blend and",
            "the part level if a",
            "side becomes silent."
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Performance loops",
      "children": [
        {
          "title": "Record and play",
          "lines": [
            "Record captures",
            "notes, pressure, stack",
            "holds and knob",
            "movements as data.",
            "Shift + Record",
            "captures audio",
            "instead.",
            "",
            "Choose Replace or",
            "Overdub on",
            "Performance Loop.",
            "Press Record to",
            "start and again to",
            "finish. Notes already",
            "held are included.",
            "Play stops or starts",
            "the loop.",
            "",
            "All parts share one",
            "recorder. Rate",
            "changes performance",
            "speed; the source",
            "samples remain",
            "separate."
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Undo an overdub",
          "lines": [
            "Overdub adds a take",
            "to the existing loop",
            "without changing its",
            "length.",
            "",
            "Finish recording with",
            "Record. Hold Delete",
            "and press Record to",
            "remove the newest",
            "overdub. Repeat for",
            "earlier passes. The",
            "base take is",
            "protected.",
            "",
            "The curved-arrow",
            "Undo key handles the",
            "latest protected",
            "sample, clip or chain",
            "edit instead."
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Clips and chains",
          "lines": [
            "Step 1-16 selects a",
            "clip in the current",
            "bank. From waveform",
            "or parameter views,",
            "Left/Right selects",
            "banks A-D. Each clip",
            "owns its performance,",
            "settings and four",
            "sample assignments.",
            "",
            "Shift + Play cycles",
            "Clip Overview, Chain",
            "and waveform. In",
            "Chain, Step keys",
            "select chain entries;",
            "Left/Right selects",
            "entry pages.",
            "",
            "Chain entries choose",
            "clips, repeats and",
            "fade behavior. Chain",
            "bank stores multiple",
            "chains. End can Loop,",
            "Stay or Stop",
            "transport."
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Pattern fades",
          "lines": [
            "Pattern Fade blends",
            "two playing clips,",
            "including their",
            "samples and settings.",
            "TIME reaches 30",
            "seconds; CUT changes",
            "immediately.",
            "",
            "FIX sets one",
            "duration. RAND",
            "chooses between LOW",
            "and HIGH. CURVE",
            "shapes the blend.",
            "",
            "Touch knob 3 to",
            "engage Hold; turn",
            "XFADE to move",
            "manually. Releasing",
            "touch keeps Hold on.",
            "Main click resumes.",
            "DONE commits the",
            "destination."
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Shortcuts / safety",
      "children": [
        {
          "title": "Capture gestures",
          "lines": [
            "Hold Capture for",
            "bottom-row",
            "performance pads.",
            "Pads 1-4 grab lanes;",
            "pads 5-8 apply DARK,",
            "CRSH, ECHO and SPCE.",
            "Pressure changes",
            "strength. Release",
            "restores the current",
            "settings.",
            "",
            "Available lanes follow",
            "the part; Quad has no",
            "lane rides. Shift +",
            "Capture saves",
            "Schwung Skipback",
            "audio."
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Copy and clear",
          "lines": [
            "Shift + Step copies",
            "the current clip to",
            "that destination.",
            "Delete + Step resets",
            "the destination clip",
            "and its sources.",
            "",
            "In clip and chain",
            "views, Copy copies a",
            "recorded clip; Shift +",
            "Copy pastes. In Chain,",
            "paste creates an",
            "independent clip for",
            "the selected entry.",
            "",
            "Outside the reports,",
            "Shift + Delete clears",
            "the selected audio",
            "lane. Stop recording",
            "before Undo.",
            "",
            "Stop playback before",
            "pasting over the",
            "current clip."
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Undo and panic",
          "lines": [
            "The curved-arrow",
            "Undo key restores",
            "the latest protected",
            "sample, clip or chain",
            "edit. Stop recording",
            "first.",
            "",
            "Hold Delete and press",
            "Play for Panic. It",
            "stops the",
            "performance and",
            "releases notes,",
            "latches, Rolls and",
            "preview. Effect tails",
            "decay. Audio-lane",
            "recording continues."
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Timing reports",
          "lines": [
            "Shift + Menu opens",
            "System Report.",
            "Left/Right, Up/Down",
            "or main turn selects",
            "the four report",
            "pages.",
            "",
            "Render Timing shows",
            "CPU PEAK, WALL PEAK,",
            "WAIT PEAK and CPU",
            "MISSES. CPU time",
            "measures work; wall",
            "time includes waiting.",
            "",
            "While a report is",
            "open, Shift + Delete",
            "resets its counters.",
            "Back or Menu closes",
            "the reports."
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Leave and save",
          "lines": [
            "Back closes a",
            "secondary view. From",
            "the main waveform,",
            "Back saves and exits",
            "takeover. Let pending",
            "saving finish before",
            "powering off.",
            "",
            "For this help, leave",
            "takeover and open",
            "Schwung Global",
            "Settings, System,",
            "Help, Modules, s3g",
            "Thru."
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Full manual",
          "lines": [
            "Illustrated manual:",
            "",
            "s3g.github.io/",
            "s3g-thru/",
            "",
            "Complete engine",
            "parameters, diagrams",
            "and the MIDI map."
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
